     * (owner, 2026-11-14): a visitor comes about every 10 minutes, so Chexy shows up roughly once in 5-6 hours.
     */
    static final float CHEXY_CHANCE = 0.03f;

    @Override
    public String toString()
    {
        return label;
    }
}

